remove a worktree's environment: containers, volumes, networks, images, home,
and registration

Usage:
  treerig worktree remove [identifier] [flags]

Flags:
      --config string            path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above
                                 cwd, if any)
      --domain string            narrow a slug registered under more than one
                                 domain
  -h, --help                     help for remove
      --label-namespace string   supply the Docker label namespace when nothing
                                 on disk records it (a worktree of another
                                 repository, or run without a treerig.toml)
      --yes                      skip the confirmation phrase

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto (redraw on a terminal) or
                        plain (one line per change) (default "auto")
  -v, --verbose         show what treerig runs, and every detail
